 "remarks": "This recently renovated 1 bed/1 bath apartment has immediate availability and is ready for you to move right in! This unit features newer floors throughout and spacious living spaces including a generously sized living room, bedroom, and a extra space that would be perfect as an office or work out space. The kitchen has updated cabinets, quartz countertops, & stainless steel appliances. The unit looks out to a picturesque courtyard. The laundry room is conveniently located only steps away from the unit. The monthly rent includes gas and hot water. There is plenty of parking in the back lot and you can purchase a garage spot for $50/month (pending availability). Renter's insurance will be required. This unit will not last so don't miss the opportunity to make it yours!",
